题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["225 × 48 = 10800 元。","答：10800元。"],"hint":"可以把 48 看成 50 − 2。","alternative":"225 × 50 − 225 × 2 = 11250 − 450 = 10800 元。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"seed-multiplication-6","familyId":"family-multiplication-6","version":1,"text":"学校订购 136 套实验材料，每套 28 元，一共需要多少元？","answer":"3808","unit":"元","knowledgeId":"multiplication","difficulty":"巩固","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["136 × 28 = 3808 元。","答：3808元。"],"hint":"把 28 拆成 20 和 8，再把两部分的积相加。","alternative":"136 × 20 + 136 × 8 = 2720 + 1088 = 3808 元。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"seed-multiplication-7","familyId":"family-multiplication-7","version":1,"text":"每个书架放 108 本书，23 个书架共放多少本？","answer":"2484","unit":"本","knowledgeId":"multiplication","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["108 × 23 = 2484 本。","答：2484本。"],"hint":"三位数乘两位数时，注意十位积的位置。","alternative":"108 × 20 + 108 × 3 = 2160 + 324 = 2484 本。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"seed-multiplication-8","familyId":"family-multiplication-8","version":1,"text":"一台机器每分钟生产 205 个零件，14 分钟共生产多少个？","answer":"2870","unit":"个","knowledgeId":"multiplication","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["205 × 14 = 2870 个。","答：2870个。"],"hint":"先计算乘 10 与乘 4 的两个部分。","alternative":"205 × 10 + 205 × 4 = 2050 + 820 = 2870 个。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer"