er","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"seed-review-division-1","familyId":"family-review-division-1","version":1,"text":"科技小组有 364 个零件，每 14 个装入一个盒子，可以装满多少盒？","answer":"26","unit":"盒","knowledgeId":"division","difficulty":"巩固","source":"小禾教研原创待审核样例","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示","steps":["364 ÷ 14 = 26。","验算：26 × 14 = 364。","答：可以装满 26 盒。"],"hint":"先计算 14 × 20，再看剩下多少个零件。","alternative":"364 = 280 + 84，280 ÷ 14 + 84 ÷ 14 = 20 + 6 = 26。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","createdAt":"2026-10-26T08:28:47.749Z","reviewerId":"local_seedy","reviewNote":"权限验证独立审核"}],"papers":[{"id":"36809b7c-d613-409a-b6dc-81b6b014c6a1","title":"我的针对练习","version":1,"createdAt":"2026-10-26T08:28:48.082Z","questionIds":["seed-division-2"],"questions":[{"id":"seed-division-2","familyId":"family-division-2","version":1,"text":"一盒彩笔有 24 支。288 支彩笔可以装满多少盒？","answer":"12","unit":"盒","knowledgeId":"division","difficulty":"基础","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["288 ÷ 24 = 12。","答：12盒。"],"hint":"用彩笔总数除以每盒的支数。","alternative":"24 × 10 = 240，还剩 48 支，可再装 2 盒，共 12 盒。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"}],"status":"ready","kind":"practice","reason":"按已学范围与薄弱知识点组卷，使用已审核题目，避开已看帮助和近 14 天试卷中的题族。","estimatedMinutes":2},{"id":"122bd489-f66b-47b1-9357-325660f8d24e","title":"我的针对练习","version":1,"createdAt":"2026-10-26T08:28:48.000Z","questionIds":["seed-division-1","seed-geometry-1"],"questions":[{"id":"seed-division-1","familyId":"family-division-1","version":1,"text":"图书角新买了 168 本书，平均分给 12 个小组，每组分到多少本？","answer":"14","unit":"本","knowledgeId":"division","difficulty":"基础","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["168 ÷ 12 = 14。","答：14本。"],"hint":"先想 12 乘几等于 168。","alternative":"把 168 拆成 120 和 48，分别除以 12，10 + 4 = 1