样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"demo-original-q-4","familyId":"demo-original-family-4","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"equal-sharing","text":"把 624 张卡片平均装入 26 个袋子，每袋多少张？","answer":"24","unit":"张","knowledgeId":"division","difficulty":"巩固","source":"演示历史 · 非真实学生作答","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["624 ÷ 26 = 24。","答：24张。"],"hint":"先试商 20，再计算剩余张数。","alternative":"26 × 20 = 520，剩 104，104 ÷ 26 = 4，所以商是 24。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"demo-original-q-5","familyId":"demo-original-family-5","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"average-production","text":"工人 15 天做了 375 个零件，平均每天做多少个？","answer":"25","unit":"个","knowledgeId":"division","difficulty":"巩固","source":"演示历史 · 非真实学生作答","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["375 ÷ 15 = 25。","答：25个。"],"hint":"平均每天的数量 = 总数量 ÷ 天数。","alternative":"300 ÷ 15 = 20，75 ÷ 15 = 5，相加得 25。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"demo-original-q-6","familyId":"demo-original-family-6","version":2,"taskType":"basic","contextId":"rectangle-perimeter","text":"一个长方形长 12 厘米、宽 8 厘米，它的周长是多少厘米？","answer":"40","unit":"厘米","knowledgeId":"geometry","difficulty":"基础","source":"演示历史 · 非真实学生作答","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["(12 + 8) × 2 = 40 厘米。","答：40厘米。"],"hint":"长和宽各有两条。","alternative":"12 × 2 + 8 × 2 = 40 厘米。","prerequisites":["长度单位与乘法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"demo-original-q-7","familyId":"demo-original-family-7","version":2,"taskType":"basic","contextId":"rectangle-area","text":"一个长方形长 15 米、宽 6 米，它的面积是多少平方米？","answer"