:"division","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["384 ÷ 16 = 24。","答：24段。"],"hint":"求段数，用绳子总长度除以每段长度；先试商 20。","alternative":"384 = 320 + 64，320 ÷ 16 + 64 ÷ 16 = 20 + 4 = 24 段。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-division-8@2:fd34aa456f53e5c52c5da1103cc29089bfaa227ba4f0043944917e75e24c70b9","questionId":"seed-division-8","version":2,"digest":"fd34aa456f53e5c52c5da1103cc29089bfaa227ba4f0043944917e75e24c70b9","question":{"id":"seed-division-8","familyId":"family-division-8","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"weight-packing","text":"一批 728 千克苹果，每筐装 28 千克，正好装多少筐？","answer":"26","unit":"筐","knowledgeId":"division","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["728 ÷ 28 = 26。","答：26筐。"],"hint":"28 × 20 = 560，剩余的还能装几筐？","alternative":"728 = 560 + 168，20 + 6 = 26 筐。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-division-9@2:8d94b9da860f7de05f42551dd252b420a9878a3979a96169bf56c2d5545187fd","questionId":"seed-division-9","version":2,"digest":"8d94b9da860f7de05f42551dd252b420a9878a3979a96169bf56c2d5545187fd","question":{"id":"seed-division-9","familyId":"family-division-9","version":2,"taskType":"transfer","contextId":"reserve-then-share","text":"社区准备了 552 本练习本，先留出 48 本备用，剩下的平均分给 24 个班。每班分到多少本？","answer":"21","unit":"本","knowledgeId":"division","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["参与分配：552 − 48 = 504 本；每班：504 ÷ 24 = 21 本。","答：21本。"],"hint":"先求真正参与平均分的数量，再除以班级数。","alternative":"先检查 24 × 21 = 504，再加上备用的 48 本，正好是 552 本。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"publis