urceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["7 × 7 = 49 平方分米。","答：49平方分米。"],"hint":"正方形面积等于边长乘边长。","alternative":"每排 7 个 1 平方分米，共 7 排，是 49 平方分米。","prerequisites":["长度单位与乘法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-geometry-5@2:ef215d6bba67733a0106b65d182ca97bb152bdb02ba76fde5014f2a7bbef8080","questionId":"seed-geometry-5","version":2,"digest":"ef215d6bba67733a0106b65d182ca97bb152bdb02ba76fde5014f2a7bbef8080","question":{"id":"seed-geometry-5","familyId":"family-geometry-5","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"inverse-perimeter","text":"一个长方形周长 50 厘米，长 16 厘米，宽是多少厘米？","answer":"9","unit":"厘米","knowledgeId":"geometry","difficulty":"巩固","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["50 ÷ 2 − 16 = 9 厘米。","答：9厘米。"],"hint":"先求长与宽的和。","alternative":"两条宽合计 50 − 16 × 2 = 18，宽是 18 ÷ 2 = 9 厘米。","prerequisites":["长度单位与乘法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-geometry-6@2:999a63c1af1202d258efaa57ee48984f3eb8f9a70fa2d77b91ec32b6c5bb3239","questionId":"seed-geometry-6","version":2,"digest":"999a63c1af1202d258efaa57ee48984f3eb8f9a70fa2d77b91ec32b6c5bb3239","question":{"id":"seed-geometry-6","familyId":"family-geometry-6","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"perimeter-to-area","text":"一个正方形的周长是 64 厘米，它的面积是多少平方厘米？","answer":"256","unit":"平方厘米","knowledgeId":"geometry","difficulty":"巩固","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["边长：64 ÷ 4 = 16 厘米；面积：16 × 16 = 256 平方厘米。","答：256平方厘米。"],"hint":"先用周长除以 4 求边长，再求面积。","alternative":"边长为 16 厘米，面积也可算成 16 × (10 + 6) = 160 + 96 = 256 平方厘米。","prerequisites":["长度单位与乘法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-geometry-7@2:c24774690ddbdcf643ec5d5b66f97a84a06952adf74016c3c2315e094213e078","questionId":"seed-geometry-7","version":2,"digest":"c24774690ddbdcf643ec5d5b66f97a84a06952adf74016c3c2315e094213e078","question":{"id":"seed-geometry-7","familyId":"family-geometry-7","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"area-change","text":"一个长方形长 18 厘米、宽 12 厘米，把长增加 5 厘米、宽保持不变，面积增加多少平方厘米？","answer":"60","unit":"平方厘米","knowledgeId":"geometry","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["增加的面积：5 × 12 = 60 平方厘米。","答：60平方厘米。"],"hint":"增加的部分是一个长 5 厘米、宽 12 厘米的长方形。","alternative":"新面积 23 × 12 = 276 平方厘米，原面积 18 × 12 = 216 平方厘米，相差 60 平方厘米。","prerequisites":["长度单位与乘法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-geometry-8@2:1d6894c19d6d6d29f4bc0df869224e5d3639cc398813b17a78b54280bd6fc002","questionId":"seed-geometry-8","version":2,"digest":"1d6894c19d6d6d29f4bc0df869224e5d3639cc398813b17a78b54280bd6fc002","question":{"id":"seed-geometry-8","familyId":"family-geometry-8","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"inverse-area","text":"一个长方形面积为 96 平方厘米，长 12 厘米，宽是多少厘米？","answer":"8","unit":"厘米","knowledgeId":"geometry","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["96 ÷ 12 = 8 厘米。","答：8厘米。"],"hint":"宽 = 面积 ÷ 长。","alternative":"12 × 8 = 96，所以宽是 8 厘米。","prerequisites":["长度单位与乘法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-geometry-9@2:03c28b46588301aaa55fa7e18fc2c1fc579f5b3265c6ebdc05defec10e996f38","questionId":"seed-geometry-9","version":2,"digest":"03c28b46588301aaa55fa7e18fc2c1fc579f5b3265c6ebdc05defec10e996f38","question":{"id":"seed-geometry-9","familyId":"family-geometry-9","version":2,"taskType":"transfer","contextId":"same-area-different-boundary","text":"一张长方形纸长 18 厘米、宽 8 厘米，另一张正方形纸边长 12 厘米。两张纸的面积相同，它们的周长相差多少厘米？","answer":"4","unit":"厘米","knowledgeId":"geometry","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["长方形周长：(18 + 8) × 2 = 52 厘米；正方形周长：12 × 4 = 48 厘米；相差：52 − 48 = 4 厘米。","答：4厘米。"],"hint":"面积相同不代表周长相同，要分别计算两张纸的边界长度。","alternative":"两张纸面积都是 144 平方厘米，但周长分别为 52 和 48 厘米，说明面积相同仍可能有不同周长。","prerequisites":["长度单位与乘法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-geometry-10@2:5cba010ee590cc6b6e4a76bf4ed0e6e93362247bb289e3fe79e1db1e8cd1cbe1","questionId":"seed-geometry-10","version":2,"digest":"5cba010ee590cc6b6e4a76bf4ed0e6e93362247bb289e3fe79e1db1e8cd1cbe1","question":{"id":"seed-geometry-10","familyId":"family-geometry-10","version":2,"taskType":"transfer","contextId":"fixed-perimeter-reshape","text":"用一根长 64 厘米的铁丝围成一个正方形，再把这根铁丝改围成长 20 厘米的长方形，铁丝没有剩余。长方形的面积是多少平方厘米？","answer":"240","unit":"平方厘米","knowledgeId":"geometry","difficulty":"挑战","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["长方形宽：64 ÷ 2 − 20 = 12 厘米；面积：20 × 12 = 240 平方厘米。","答：240平方厘米。"],"hint":"改围前后周长相同。先由周长和长求宽，再求面积。","alternative":"去掉两条长还剩 64 − 20 × 2 = 24 厘米，两条宽各 12 厘米；20 × 12 = 240 平方厘米。","prerequisites":["长度单位与乘法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-multiplication-1@2:15a972c0c3a438c2b7b9dc43e9ddb62cbde366b14d21cce26a412b33bb481c1b","questionId":"seed-multiplication-1","version":2,"digest":"15a972c0c3a438c2b7b9dc43e9ddb62cbde366b14d21cce26a412b33bb481c1b","question":{"id":"seed-multiplication-1","familyId":"family-multiplication-1","versio