980 本。","答：1980本。"],"hint":"可以把 15 拆成 10 和 5。","alternative":"132 × 10 + 132 × 5 = 1320 + 660 = 1980 本。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-multiplication-4@2:20c9041c95553aabfcb2a87f1f867b8fbd841eb62ed889c184eb3ea60226bd00","questionId":"seed-multiplication-4","version":2,"digest":"20c9041c95553aabfcb2a87f1f867b8fbd841eb62ed889c184eb3ea60226bd00","question":{"id":"seed-multiplication-4","familyId":"family-multiplication-4","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"distance-from-rate","text":"一列火车平均每小时行 165 千米，行驶 12 小时共行多少千米？","answer":"1980","unit":"千米","knowledgeId":"multiplication","difficulty":"巩固","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["165 × 12 = 1980 千米。","答：1980千米。"],"hint":"路程 = 速度 × 时间，先求 10 小时和 2 小时的路程。","alternative":"165 × 10 + 165 × 2 = 1650 + 330 = 1980 千米。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNote":"演示题解已样例校核，正式教材范围待教研确认。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T08:00:00.000Z"},"source":"baseline"},{"id":"seed-multiplication-5@2:e6d2752daf5a83ce26c0ddc52a11210530bce214de25530a40da1a40ea8e85b6","questionId":"seed-multiplication-5","version":2,"digest":"e6d2752daf5a83ce26c0ddc52a11210530bce214de25530a40da1a40ea8e85b6","question":{"id":"seed-multiplication-5","familyId":"family-multiplication-5","version":2,"taskType":"application","contextId":"purchase-total","text":"每张书桌售价 225 元，学校购买 48 张共需要多少元？","answer":"10800","unit":"元","knowledgeId":"multiplication","difficulty":"巩固","source":"小禾教研原创演示题 · 非教材授权题库","sourceScope":"小学四年级数学演示 · 知识范围需教研校验","steps":["225 × 48 = 10800 元。","答：10800元。"],"hint":"可以把 48 看成 50 − 2。","alternative":"225 × 50 − 225 × 2 = 11250 − 450 = 10800 元。","prerequisites":["整数乘除法"],"status":"published","authorId":"seed-author","reviewerId":"seed-reviewer","reviewNo